B.V0=new A.fe("Myth: Irregular periods always mean something is wrong.","Not necessarily. Cycles can vary due to stress, travel, or weight changes. Consistently irregular cycles over several months are what's worth checking with a doctor.")
B.UX=new A.fe("Myth: You lose a lot of blood during your period.","Most people lose only 2 to 3 tablespoons of blood across an entire period, even though it can feel like more.")
