B.T9=new A.bk("Runs in families","affecting around 50% of first-degree relatives (mother, sister) of someone with PCOS.",null)
B.SJ=new A.bk("Most common cause of secondary amenorrhea","accounting for roughly 37% of cases where periods stop, ahead of premature ovarian insufficiency, high prolactin, and weight-related causes.",null)
