B.Tv=new A.bk(null,"Endometriosis occurs when endometrial-like tissue implants on organs outside the uterus \u2014 most commonly the ovaries, fallopian tubes, and pelvic lining. This tissue responds to hormonal changes just like the uterine lining, causing inflammation, scarring, and pain.",null)
